#: index.php:111
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Putanga"

#: index.php:144 index.php:286
msgid "Create bootable USB drives the easy way"
msgstr "Waihangatia ngā puku USB ka taea te whakaara"

#: index.php:230
msgid "Change language:"
msgstr "Huri Reo:"

#: index.php:239
msgid "Want to improve this translation?"
msgstr "Kei te hiahia koe ki te whakapai ake i tēnei takatau?"

#: index.php:313
msgid ""
"Rufus is a utility that helps format and create bootable USB flash drives, "
"such as USB keys/pendrives, memory sticks, etc."
msgstr ""
"He whaipainga a Rufus hei āwhina ki te hōputu me te waihanga i ngā puku "
"kohiko USB ka taea te whakaara, pēnei i ngā pātuhi USB/penedrives, ngā rākau"
" pūmahara, te aha atu anō."

#: index.php:314
msgid "It can be especially useful for cases where:"
msgstr "Ka tino whaitake mō ngā take i reira:"

#: index.php:316
msgid ""
"you need to create USB installation media from bootable ISOs (Windows, "
"Linux, UEFI, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"me waihanga pāpāho utanga USB mai i ngā ISO e taea te whakaara (Windows, "
"Linux, UEFI, ērā atu mea.)"

#: index.php:317
msgid "you need to work on a system that doesn't have an OS installed"
msgstr "me mahi koe ki tētahi pūnaha kāore he OS kua tāutatia"

#: index.php:318
msgid "you need to flash a BIOS or other firmware from DOS"
msgstr "me kōhiko tētahi BIOS, tētahi atu pūmanamārō rānei mai i DOS"

#: index.php:319
msgid "you want to run a low-level utility"
msgstr "e hiahia ana koe ki te whakahaere i tētahi taputapu taumata-hahaka"

#: index.php:321
msgid "Despite its small size, Rufus provides everything you need!"
msgstr ""
"Ahakoa tōna rahi iti, ka homai e Rufus ngā mea katoa e hiahiatia ana e koe!"

#: index.php:322
msgid ""
"A non exhaustive list of Rufus supported ISOs is also provided at the bottom"
" of this page."
msgstr ""
"E whakaratoa ana hoki he rārangi ngaio o Whēpuha e tautokona ana i ngā ISO i"
" raro i tēnei whārangi."

