#: index.php:378
msgid "System Requirements:"
msgstr "Ngā Whakaritenga Pūnaha:"

#: index.php:379
msgid "Windows 8 or later."
msgstr "Ehara te Windows 8 o muri ake rānei."

#: index.php:379
msgid "Once downloaded, the application is ready to use."
msgstr "Ina tikiake, kua rite te taupānga ki te whakamahi."

#: index.php:380
