msgstr "Ngā Reo e Tautokona ana:"

#: index.php:426
msgid ""
"I will take this opportunity to express my gratitude to the translators who "
"made it possible for Rufus, as well as this webpage, to be translated in "
"various languages. If you find that you can use Rufus in your own language, "
"you should really thank them!"
msgstr ""
"Ka tangohia e au tēnei wā hai whakapuaki i taku whakamihi ki nga "
"kaiwhakamāori i whakaae kia taea e Rupuha, me tēnei whārangi tukutuku hoki, "
"te whakamāori i roto i ētahi reo rerekē. Ki te kite koe ka taea e koe te "
"whakamahi a Rupuhi i tō ake reo, me tino mihi koe ki a rātau!"

#: index.php:277 index.php:429
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Te Whakamahinga"

#: index.php:430
msgid ""
"Download the executable and run it &ndash; no installation is necessary."
msgstr ""
"Tikiake i te kawenga kawekawe ka whakahaeretia &ndash; kāore he tikanga "
"tāutatanga."

#: index.php:431
msgid "The executable is digitally signed and the signature should state:"
msgstr "Kua waitohu mamatitia te kawenga, ā, me āhua te waitohu:"

#: index.php:433
msgid "(v1.3.0 or later)"
msgstr "(v1.3.0 o muri ake rānei)"

#: index.php:434
msgid "(v1.2.0 or earlier)"
msgstr "(v1.2.0 neke atu rānei)"

#: index.php:436
msgid "Notes on DOS support:"
msgstr "Ngā tuhipoka i te tautoko DOS:"

#: index.php:437
msgid ""
"If you create a DOS bootable drive and use a non-US keyboard, Rufus will "
"attempt to select a keyboard layout according to the locale of your system."
msgstr ""
"Mēnā ka waihangatia e koe tētahi puku whakaara DOS me te whakamahi i tētahi "
"papapātuhi kore-US, ka ngana a Rufus ki te tīpako i tētahi tahora papapātuhi"
" e ai ki te wāhi paetata o tō pūnaha."

#: index.php:438
msgid "Notes on ISO Support:"
msgstr "Ngā Tuhipoka i te Tautoko ISO:"

#: index.php:439
#, php-format
msgid ""
"All versions of Rufus since v1.1.0 allow the creation of a bootable USB from"
" an <a target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO image</a> (.iso)."
msgstr ""
"Ka whakaaetia e ngā putanga katoa o Rufus mai i te v1.1.0 te waihangatanga o"
" tētahi USB taea te whakaara mai i tētahi <a target=\"_blank\" %s>atahanga "
"ISO</a> (.iso)."

#: index.php:440
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Creating an ISO image from a physical disc or from a set of files is very "
"easy to do however, through the use of a CD burning application, such as the"
" freely available <a target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> or <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>CDBurnerXP</a>."
msgstr ""
"He māmā noa iho te waihanga atahanga ISO mai i tētahi kōpae ōkiko, mai i "
"tētahi huinga kōnae rānei, mā te whakamahi i tētahi taupānga whakawera KK, "
"pēnei i te <a target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> wātea koreutu, te <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>CDBurnerXP</a> rānei."

#: index.php:443
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)"
msgstr "Ngā Pātai Auau"

#. You are encouraged to add the translation for " (in English)." after
#. "HERE</a></b>" as the FAQ is only available in English
#: index.php:444
#, php-format
msgid "A Rufus FAQ is available <b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>HERE</a></b>."
msgstr "E wātea ana<a target=\"_blank\" %s>i konei</a> ngā Pātai Auau a Rufus."

#: index.php:445
#, php-format
msgid ""
"To provide feedback, report a bug or request an enhancement, please use the "
"GitHub <a target=\"_blank\" %s>issue tracker</a>. Or you can <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>send an e-mail</a>."
msgstr ""
"Hei tuku urupare, pūrongotia he iro, he tono whakarei rānei, whakamahia koa "
"te <a target=\"_blank\" %s>pūaroturuki take</a> GitHub. Ka taea rānei <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>te tuku ī-mēra</a>."

#: index.php:448
msgid "License"
msgstr "Raihana"

#: index.php:449
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU General Public License (GPL) version 3</a> or "
"later."
msgstr ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU General Public License (GPL) putanga 3</a> o "
"muri ake rānei."

#: index.php:449
msgid ""
"You are free to distribute, modify or even sell the software, insofar as you"
" respect the GPLv3 license."
msgstr ""
"Kei te wātea koe ki te tohatoha, ki te whakakē, ki te hoko rānei i ngā "
"pūmanawa, mō te wātea i a koe e manaaki ana i te raihana GPLv3."

#: index.php:450
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Rufus is produced in a 100%% transparent manner, from its <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>public source</a>, using a <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>MinGW32</a> environment."
msgstr ""
"I hangaia a Rufus kia 100%% pūata, mai i tōna <a target=\"_blank\" %s>pūtake"
" iwi whānui</a>, mā te taiao <a target=\"_blank\" %s>MinGW32</a>."

#. You are encouraged to append the translation for "(in English)" after
#. "Changelog" as it is only available in English
#: index.php:453
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "Tīniwha"

#: index.php:279 index.php:485
msgid "Source Code"
msgstr "Waehere pūtake"

#: index.php:487
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can clone the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> repository "
"using:"
msgstr ""
"Otiia, ka taea e koe te tārua i te kaipupuri <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a>"
" mā te whakamahi:"

#: index.php:489
#, php-format
msgid "For more information, see the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>GitHub project</a>."
msgstr ""
"Mō ētahi atu mōhiohio, tirohia <a target=\"_blank\" %s>te kaupapa "
"GitHub</a>."

#: index.php:490
msgid ""
"If you are a developer, you are very much encouraged to tinker with Rufus "
"and submit patches."
msgstr ""
"Mēnā he kaiwhakawhanake koe, he tino whakahauhautia koe ki te tākaro i a "
"Rufus me te tāpae kōrero."

#: index.php:280 index.php:493
msgid "Donations"
msgstr "Ngā Koha"

#: index.php:494
msgid ""
"Since I'm getting asked about this on regular basis, there is <b>no</b> "
"donation button on this page."
msgstr ""
"I te mea kei te pātai au mō tēnei i runga anō, <b>kāore</b> he pātene tuku "
"ki tēnei whārangi."

#: index.php:495
msgid ""
"The main reason is that I feel that the donation system doesn't actually "
"help software development and worse, can be guilt-inducing for users who "
"choose not to donate."
msgstr ""
"Ko te take nui, ko taku whakaaro kāore te pūnaha koha e āwhina ki te "
"whanaketanga pūmanawa, kino atu rānei, he whakaputa hara ki ngā kaiwhakamahi"
" e kōwhiri ana kia kaua e tuku."

#: index.php:498
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If you really insist, you can always make a donation to the <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>Free Software Foundation</a>, as they are the main "
"reason software like Rufus is possible."
msgstr ""
"Mēnā kei te tohe tonu koe, ka taea e koe te tuku i tētahi koha ki te <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>Tūranga Pūmanawa Koreutu</a> i ngā wā katoa, he pērā "
"rawa te pūmanawa take i pērā ai a Rufus."

#: index.php:499
msgid ""
"At any rate, I'll take this opportunity to say <i><u>thank you</u></i> for "
"your continuing support and enthusiasm about this little program: it is much"
" appreciated!"
msgstr ""
"Ahakoa he aha te wā, māku e whakamōhio atu ki a koe mō tō tautoko haere tonu"
" me tō hiahia mō tēnei papatono iti: he tino whakamihi!"

#: index.php:500
msgid ""
"But please continue to feel free to use Rufus without any guilt about not "
"contributing for it financially &ndash; you should never have to!"
msgstr ""
"Engari me haere tonu ki te whakawātea ki te whakamahi i a Rupuha, ā, kaore "
"he hara mo te kore e mahi i tēnā moni &ndash; kaua rawa koe e whai take!"

#: index.php:503
msgid "Non exhaustive list of ISOs Rufus is known to work with"
msgstr "E mōhiotia ana te rārangi ngaio o ISOs Rufus e mahi tahi ana me"

